      "🔥 Pro Tip (Interview): SELECT (Retrieve Data) ➔ DISTINCT (Remove Duplicates) ➔ ORDER BY (Optional Sort Results). In interviews, when asked 'How to display all unique values?', DISTINCT is your go-to keyword! 🚀"
